OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, appears in court charged
OL,4,Awith murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with the murder of a man in
OL,8,FDungannon, County Tyrone, and the
OL,9,Fattempted murder of two other people in
OL,10,Fthe same incident.
OL,12,FThe body of the dead man, who was 61,
OL,13,Fwas found alongside his injured
OL,14,Feight-year-old daughter at a house on
OL,15,FLisnahull Road on Saturday morning.
OL,17,FThe man's 48-year-old wife sustained
OL,18,Fnon-life threatening injuries during
OL,19,Fthe attack.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
