OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, appears in court charged
OL,4,Awith murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 16-year-old defendant, who cannot
OL,7,Fbe named because of his age, was also
OL,8,Fcharged with making threats to kill. He
OL,9,Fappeared in court in Omagh on Tuesday
OL,10,Fmorning and was remanded in custody.
